  "bio": "Timo Müller is a master of neotraditional tattoo art, operating with exceptional professionalism out of his well-established Skindeep Studio. Since beginning his journey as a tattoo artist in 2002, Timo has earned a sterling reputation in Bad Kreuznach, Germany, for delivering exquisite tattoos that combine classic motifs with modern twists. His dedication to his craft ensures every piece is a unique and enduring work of art.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Bad Kreuznach, Rhineland-palatinate, Germany\n\nGeschäftsinhaber Skindeep Studio Tätowierer seit 2002 Bad Kreuznach Rheinland-Pfalz Germany🌊",
